      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>November 7, 2026</color>\n\"Well, well, if it isn't our dearest head maid! Off to buy groceries? Ooh, tight-lipped today, are we...? Hehe, a se~cret mis~sion. I get it, I get it! Let me give you a lift. It's freezing out, so hop on! Ahem... Ignoring me doesn't make you look cool, you know. Hey, where are you going? Heeey—!\"\n— Vesna, calling out to Danica from inside a train the day before her driving ban was issued\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/47351623</color>"
